<div style="padding:20px;">

    <h2>Our Story</h2>

    <p>
        Fourth Coffee was founded in 2010 with a simple idea:
        deliver great coffee and fresh baked goods right to your door.
    </p>

    <p>
        In another life, Bill Baker was a developer by day and pastry
        chef by night. His passion for butter, flour and sugar soon
        became more powerful than his programming talents.
    </p>

    <p>
        What started as a way to satisfy his own sweet tooth became
        an exciting journey and eventually Fourth Coffee.
    </p>

    <p>
        Today, Fourth Coffee brings together delicious coffee,
        pastries, cookies and cakes with a modern online ordering
        experience.
    </p>

